{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ponchyo: A Platypus Adventure</strong> is a charming 3D platformer collectathon full of adventure - and a little touch of nostalgia! Step into the shoes (Wait... platypuses don't have shoes, right? No idea!) of Ponchyo the platypus! Collect coins and discover new furniture to decorate your home. <strong>The demo includes the first level, a few furnitures to collect for your house and one upgrade for Ponchyo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect coins!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/b62361df2a921ca947689839acffcd68.poster.avif?t=1755017605\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/b62361df2a921ca947689839acffcd68.webm?t=1755017605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/b62361df2a921ca947689839acffcd68.mp4?t=1755017605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to unlock the first level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uh-oh, enemies ahead!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/5c5f7fa01117e03658754448b8b4fab5.poster.avif?t=1755017605\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/5c5f7fa01117e03658754448b8b4fab5.webm?t=1755017605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will try to stop you on your journey! Take them down before they deal damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges await!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/4b6643fa98c302acf370eaf13844067c.poster.avif?t=1755017605\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/4b6643fa98c302acf370eaf13844067c.webm?t=1755017605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/4b6643fa98c302acf370eaf13844067c.mp4?t=1755017605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course there are some challenges and mini-games - come on, it\u2019s a collectathon! What did you expect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/69fe7ea49eb2874c27b94aef6a2b093f.poster.avif?t=1755017605\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/69fe7ea49eb2874c27b94aef6a2b093f.webm?t=1755017605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find brand-new furniture for your home! Every piece you collect gets placed into your house in the hub world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades for your platypus!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/22cc52b73333b506d9ee20c713e98df2.poster.avif?t=1755017605\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/extras/22cc52b73333b506d9ee20c713e98df2.webm?t=1755017605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find an upgrade in the demo to enhance your playtpus abilities!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Potato","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3859050/de94282fb3e21894ee6a7da51d12f9eee0c56cb9.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3859050/e0e1f01ca56a1121b69808cea4d7084334a74a3b.jpg"},{"name":"Demo complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3859050/73cc4eb6626a0bb74085ee7bc2ab9d7171aab594.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859050?t=1755017605","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/7eede71ef14c4536d11e9f5d765edb007cad74a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755017605","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/c31231847710ed6eb591a7e51dcc780f4a40e9f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755017605","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859050/c31231847710ed6eb591a7e51dcc780f4a40e9f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755017605","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >